# A Rust binary links every dependency statically, including the C
# libraries some crates vendor: there is no dynamic libyaml to link
# against and no way to make cargo use the system one here. The tag is
# meant for archive packages, where a shared library must be shared so
# the security team can fix it once; this repository rebuilds and
# republishes the whole binary on every upstream release instead.
search2md: embedded-library libyaml [usr/bin/search2md]
